  <!-- EN: An enemy missile launch position has completed its strike mission and relocated to avoid counteraction. -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.RelocatedDesc>一處敵方導彈陣地在部署後完成射擊任務並轉移，防止殖民地反制。</DMSE.MissileBase.RelocatedDesc>
  <!-- EN: Missile position destroyed -->
