  <!-- EN: Your colonists have destroyed every fire-control radar at the enemy missile position. Without fire control it can no longer launch, and the missile threat from this position has been neutralized.\n\nThe position's map stays open until observation ends and no colonists remain there, so you can still send a shuttle to loot it. -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.DestroyedDesc>殖民者已摧毀敵方導彈陣地的所有火控雷達。失去火控後陣地無法再發射，來自該陣地的導彈威脅已解除。\n\n陣地地圖會保留到觀察結束、且當地沒有殖民者為止，仍可派穿梭機前往搜刮。</DMSE.MissileBase.DestroyedDesc>
  <!-- EN: Ground access denied: enemy regrouping ({0}) -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.ReentryBlockedIn>地面通道封鎖中，敵方整備防線（{0}）</DMSE.MissileBase.ReentryBlockedIn>
  <!-- EN: Access denied: enemy regrouping ({0}) -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.ReentryBlocked>通道封鎖，敵方整備防線（{0}）</DMSE.MissileBase.ReentryBlocked>
  <!-- EN: {0}: its fire-control radars still stand and the enemy is regrouping. Ground access is blocked for {1}; the position will be fully rebuilt. -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.ReentryBlockStarted>{0}：火控雷達仍在，敵方正重新整備防線。{1}內無法再次進入，陣地將完整重建。</DMSE.MissileBase.ReentryBlockStarted>
  <!-- EN: Missile position: {0} fire-control radars left -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.ObjectivesAlert>導彈陣地：剩餘火控雷達 {0}</DMSE.MissileBase.ObjectivesAlert>
  <!-- EN: Destroy every fire-control radar to neutralize this position ({0} left). Launchers and search radars do not need to be destroyed.

If you withdraw while a fire-control radar still stands, the enemy regroups: the position stays on the world map and keeps firing, your return is blocked for a while, and it is fully rebuilt on your next visit.

Click to cycle through the remaining targets. -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.ObjectivesAlertDesc>摧毀所有火控雷達即可瓦解此陣地（剩餘 {0}），發射架與搜索雷達不必摧毀。\n\n若在火控雷達尚存時撤退，敵方將重新整備：陣地留在世界地圖上繼續發射，一段時間內無法再次進入，下次進入時陣地完整重建。\n\n點擊依序檢視剩餘目標。</DMSE.MissileBase.ObjectivesAlertDesc>
  <!-- EN: Your pawns have arrived at a missile launch position. The enemy has deployed fire control radars and launch vehicles here, continuously striking nearby colonies. Destroy every fire-control radar to neutralize the position; if you withdraw while a fire-control radar still stands, the enemy regroups and blocks your return for a while. -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.ArrivedLetter>你們抵達了一處導彈陣地。敵方已在此部署火控雷達與導彈發射架，不斷向周圍殖民地發射打擊。摧毀所有火控雷達即可瓦解此陣地；若在火控雷達尚存時撤退，敵方將重新整備防線，一段時間內無法再次進入。</DMSE.MissileBase.ArrivedLetter>
  <!-- EN: A mobile tactical ballistic missile launch position equipped with fire control radar and missile launchers. The position will relocate after completing its mission. -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.SiteDesc>一處配備火控雷達與導彈發射架的機動戰術彈道導彈陣地。陣地會在完成任務後轉移，以躲避反制。</DMSE.MissileBase.SiteDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enemy supply drop: {0} ×{1} -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.SupplyDrop>敵方補給空投：{0} ×{1}</DMSE.MissileBase.SupplyDrop>
  <!-- EN: Enemy missile airdrop: {1} missiles -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.RackResupply>敵方空投導彈：{1} 枚</DMSE.MissileBase.RackResupply>
  <!-- EN: Enemy ammo airdrop: {1} ×{0} -->
  <DMSE.MissileBase.TurretAmmoDrop>敵方空投彈藥：{1} ×{0}</DMSE.MissileBase.TurretAmmoDrop>
  <!-- EN: Your pawns have arrived at an enemy field launch position. A search radar sits at its centre, with launch positions, ammunition carriers and crew shelters spread around it. Supply pods keep the garrison fed while any radar is operational. Destroy every fire-control radar to neutralize the position; if you withdraw while a fire-control radar still stands, the enemy regroups and blocks your return for a while. -->
  <DMSE.FieldLaunchSite.ArrivedLetter>你們抵達了一處敵方野戰發射陣地。陣地以搜索雷達為中心，四周散布發射陣位、彈藥車與人員休息區。只要仍有雷達運作，敵方就會定時空投生存食品包維持守軍。摧毀所有火控雷達即可瓦解此陣地；若在火控雷達尚存時撤退，敵方將重新整備防線，一段時間內無法再次進入。</DMSE.FieldLaunchSite.ArrivedLetter>
  <!-- EN: {0} has deployed a field missile launch position {3} tiles {2} of {1}. Its launchers can strike your colony; supply pods will keep its garrison fed while its radars run.\n\nDestroy every fire-control radar to neutralize it; knocking out all its radars also cuts off its supplies. -->
  <DMSE.FieldLaunchSite.SpawnedLetter>{0}在{1}的{2}方 {3} 格處部署了一處野戰導彈發射陣地。其發射架能打擊你的殖民地；只要雷達仍在運作，補給艙就會持續為守軍送來食物。\n\n摧毀所有火控雷達即可瓦解此陣地；癱瘓所有雷達也能切斷其補給。</DMSE.FieldLaunchSite.SpawnedLetter>
  <!-- EN: Your pawns have arrived at an enemy missile position. Acoustic mirrors listen for aircraft while a hand-aimed fire-control radar and launch rails send out slow pulsejet loitering munitions. Destroy its fire-control radar to neutralize it; the radar stops firing if its crew or its wood-fired generators are lost. If you retreat with a fire-control radar still standing, the enemy will rebuild its defenses and you cannot return for a while. -->
  <DMSE.EarlyLaunchSite.ArrivedLetter>你們抵達了一處敵方舊式導彈陣地。聲學反射鏡負責監聽，手動火控雷達與發射軌負責射出緩慢的脈衝噴射巡飛彈。摧毀火控雷達即可瓦解此陣地；守軍或燒木發電機沒了，火控雷達也會停擺。若在雷達尚存時撤退，敵方將重新整備防線，一段時間內無法再次進入。</DMSE.EarlyLaunchSite.ArrivedLetter>
  <!-- EN: {0} has set up a missile position {3} tiles {2} of {1}. Its slow pulsejet loitering munitions can strike your colony, and it has no interceptors of its own.\n\nDestroy its fire-control radar to neutralize it. -->
  <DMSE.EarlyLaunchSite.SpawnedLetter>{0}在{1}的{2}方 {3} 格處架設了一處舊式導彈陣地。它緩慢的脈衝噴射巡飛彈能打擊你的殖民地，陣地本身沒有攔截彈。\n\n摧毀火控雷達即可瓦解此陣地。</DMSE.EarlyLaunchSite.SpawnedLetter>

